   "en": "\"I hate summer.\"\nThe reason being... that my cousin Yuzu comes to visit every year.\nWhenever the two of us are left alone, she does all manner of things to me...\n\nIt really peeves me off how she plays and toys with me...\nand yet, my body reacts to her touch like it has a mind of its own.\nWhether it be sitting at a table, or out at the summer festival...\nI am at her beck and call.\n\nThe volition of my mind and my body separate further and further apart...\n\n\n\"I just wanted to be more normal...\"\n\n\nOn the final night of Yuzu's visit, I desperately utter such words...\nand in response, Yuzu says... ...?\n\n(Source: DLsite garumani)\n\n| Namespace | Tags |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| male | dog boy, kemonomimi, masturbation, nipple stimulation, sole male, tail |\n| female | blowjob, cousin, femdom, handjob, kemonomimi, sole female, tail, x-ray |\n| mixed | incest |",
